{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8icvjd","slideIndex":3,"text":"Sources: DuplicateQuestion_MaLSTM/results/summary.csv, results/original/outputs/prepared.npz, ensemble_predictions.npy, and model.py REFERENCE table transcribed from ATML_RP.pdf Table 4. All metrics below are percentages on the original test set. Paper column gives paper-reported accuracy only. Original ensemble confusion matrix: actual nonduplicate/predicted nonduplicate 56,883; actual nonduplicate/predicted duplicate 6,874; actual duplicate/predicted nonduplicate 11,508; actual duplicate/predicted duplicate 25,808. Calibration curves compare mean score to actual duplicate frequency per bin. A curve on the diagonal indicates good calibration."}
